                "description": "Baldwin DEC-TRR, Decorative Lever with Round Rose - The Baldwin Decorative Lever with Round Rose is lovely--a great addition to traditional homes. Choose from 6 finishes including polished brass, satin nickel and polished chrome. The Decorative leverset is easy to install and will fit most predrilled doors. It is available as a keyed entry as well as a privacy, passage, or dummy.",
